{"id":443,"name":"gible","speciesId":443,"dex":443,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["dragon","ground"],"stats":{"hp":58,"attack":70,"defense":45,"special-attack":40,"special-defense":45,"speed":42},"abilities":[{"name":"sand-veil","hidden":false},{"name":"rough-skin","hidden":true}],"height":7,"weight":205,"baseExp":60,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/443.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/443.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/443.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/443.ogg","genus":"Land Shark Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"It nests in small, horizontal holes in cave walls. It pounces to catch prey that stray too close."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It once lived in the tropics. To avoid the cold, it lives in caves warmed by geothermal heat."},{"version":"platinum","text":"It attacks using its huge mouth. While its attacks are powerful, it hurts itself out of clumsiness, too."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It nests in horizontal holes warmed by geothermal heat. Foes who get too close can expect to be pounced on and bitten."},{"version":"sun","text":"It lives in caves warmed by geothermal heat. Even so, when the weather gets cold, it will huddle close with others of its kind."},{"version":"moon","text":"It skulks in caves, and when prey or an enemy passes by, it leaps out and chomps them. The force of its attack sometimes chips its teeth."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It reacts to anything that moves—flies right at it and bites it. Sometimes it injures itself, but it doesn’t care too much."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its original home is an area much hotter than Alola. If you’re planning to live with one, your heating bill will soar."},{"version":"sword","text":"Gible p